msgid "Attempt to find another way to accomplish the same outcome."
msgstr "Poog na soek nog 'n weg na bereik die selfde resultate."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:669
msgid "File Expected"
msgstr "Lêer Verwag"

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:670
msgid ""
"The request expected a file, however the directory <strong>%1</strong> was "
"found instead."
msgstr ""
"Die versoek verwag 'n lêer, egter Die gids <strong>%1</strong> was gevind "
"in plaas van."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:672
msgid "This may be an error on the server side."
msgstr "Hierdie dalk mag wees 'n fout op die bediener kant."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:677
msgid "Directory Expected"
msgstr "Gids Verwag"

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:678
msgid ""
"The request expected a directory, however the file <strong>%1</strong> was "
"found instead."
msgstr ""
"Die versoek verwag 'n gids, egter Die lêer <strong>%1</strong> was gevind "
"in plaas van."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:685
msgid "File or Directory Does Not Exist"
msgstr "Lêer of Gids Doen Nie Bestaan"

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:686
msgid "The specified file or directory <strong>%1</strong> does not exist."
msgstr "Die gespesifiseer lêer of gids <strong>%1</strong> doen nie bestaan."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:694
msgid ""
"The requested file could not be created because a file with the same name "
"already exists."
msgstr ""
"Die versoekte lêer kon nie wees geskep omdat 'n lêer met Die selfde naam "
"alreeds bestaan."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:696
msgid "Try moving the current file out of the way first, and then try again."
msgstr ""
"Probeer beweeg die huidige lêer uit van die weg eerste, en dan word Probeer "
"weer."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:698
msgid "Delete the current file and try again."
msgstr "Uitvee die huidige lêer en probeer weer."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:699
msgid "Choose an alternate filename for the new file."
msgstr "Kies 'n alternatiwe lêernaam vir die nuwe lêer."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:704
msgid ""
"The requested directory could not be created because a directory with the "
"same name already exists."
msgstr ""
"Die versoekte gids kon nie wees geskep omdat 'n gids met Die selfde naam "
"alreeds bestaan."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:706
msgid "Try moving the current directory out of the way first, and then try again."
msgstr ""
"Probeer beweeg die huidige gids uit van die weg eerste, en dan word Probeer "
"weer."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:708
msgid "Delete the current directory and try again."
msgstr "Uitvee die huidige gids en probeer weer."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:709
msgid "Choose an alternate name for the new directory."
msgstr "Kies 'n alternatiwe naam vir die nuwe gids."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:713
msgid "Unknown Host"
msgstr "Onbekende Bediener"

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:714
msgid ""
"An unknown host error indicates that the server with the requested name, "
"<strong>%1</strong>, could not be located on the Internet."
msgstr ""
"'n onbekende bediener fout dui aan wat die bediener met die versoekte naam, "
"<strong>%1</strong>, kon nie wees geleë op die Internet."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:717
msgid "The name that you typed, %1, may not exist: it may be incorrectly typed."
msgstr ""
"Die naam wat jy getikte, %1, dalk mag nie bestaan: dit dalk mag wees "
"verkeerdelik getikte."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:724
msgid "Access Denied"
msgstr "Toegang verkry Verbied"

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:725
msgid "Access was denied to the specified resource, <strong>%1</strong>."
msgstr ""
"Toegang verkry was verbied na die gespesifiseer hulpbron, "
"<strong>%1</strong>."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:727 kio/kio/global.cpp:943
msgid "You may have supplied incorrect authentication details or none at all."
msgstr ""
"Jy dalk mag het verskaf verkeerd geldigheidsverklaring details of geen na "
"alle."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:729 kio/kio/global.cpp:945
msgid "Your account may not have permission to access the specified resource."
msgstr ""
"Jou rekening dalk mag nie het reg na toegang verkry die gespesifiseer "
"hulpbron."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:731 kio/kio/global.cpp:947 kio/kio/global.cpp:959
msgid ""
"Retry the request and ensure your authentication details are entered "
"correctly."
msgstr ""
"Herprobeer die versoek en maak seker jou geldigheidsverklaring details word "
"ingevoerde korrek."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:737
msgid "Write Access Denied"
msgstr "Skryf Toegang verkry Verbied"

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:738
msgid ""
"This means that an attempt to write to the file <strong>%1</strong> was "
"rejected."
msgstr ""
"Hierdie beteken wat 'n poog na skryf na die lêer <strong>%1</strong> was "
"verwerp."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:745
msgid "Unable to Enter Directory"
msgstr "Nie moontlik na Invoer Gids"

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:746
msgid ""
"This means that an attempt to enter (in other words, to open) the requested "
"directory <strong>%1</strong> was rejected."
msgstr ""
"Hierdie beteken wat 'n poog na invoer (in ander woorde, na open) die "
"versoekte gids <strong>%1</strong> was verwerp."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:754
msgid "Directory Listing Unavailable"
msgstr "Gids Luister na Onbeskikbaar"

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:755
msgid "Protocol %1 is not a Filesystem"
msgstr "Protokol %1 is nie 'n Lêersisteem"

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:756
msgid ""
"This means that a request was made which requires determining the contents "
"of the directory, and the KDE program supporting this protocol is unable to "
"do so."
msgstr ""
"Hierdie beteken wat 'n versoek was gemaak wat benodig bepaling die inhoud "
"van die gids, en die Kde program ondersteun Hierdie protokol is nie moontlik "
"na doen sodat."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:764
msgid "Cyclic Link Detected"
msgstr "Siklies Skakel Opgespoor"

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:765
msgid ""
"UNIX environments are commonly able to link a file or directory to a "
"separate name and/or location. KDE detected a link or series of links that "
"results in an infinite loop - i.e. the file was (perhaps in a roundabout "
"way) linked to itself."
msgstr ""
"Unix omgewings word algemeen in staat na skakel 'n lêer van gids na 'n "
"aparte naam en/van ligging. Kde opgespoor 'n skakel van reeks van skakel wat "
"resultate in 'n oneindige lus - i.e. die lêer was (miskien in 'n omslagtige "
"weg) gekoppel na self."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:769 kio/kio/global.cpp:791
msgid ""
"Delete one part of the loop in order that it does not cause an infinite "
"loop, and try again."
msgstr ""
"Uitvee een deel van die lus in volgorde wat dit doen nie veroorsaak 'n "
"oneindige lus, en probeer weer."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:778
msgid "Request Aborted By User"
msgstr "Versoek Gekanselleer Deur Gebruiker"

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:779 kio/kio/global.cpp:1072
msgid "The request was not completed because it was aborted."
msgstr "Die versoek was nie klaar omdat dit was gekanselleer."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:781 kio/kio/global.cpp:975 kio/kio/global.cpp:1074
msgid "Retry the request."
msgstr "Herprobeer die versoek."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:785
msgid "Cyclic Link Detected During Copy"
msgstr "Siklies Skakel Opgespoor Gedurende Kopie"

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:786
msgid ""
"UNIX environments are commonly able to link a file or directory to a "
"separate name and/or location. During the requested copy operation, KDE "
"detected a link or series of links that results in an infinite loop - i.e. "
"the file was (perhaps in a roundabout way) linked to itself."
msgstr ""
"Unix omgewings word algemeen in staat na skakel 'n lêer van gids na 'n "
"aparte naam en/van ligging. Gedurende die versoekte kopie operasie, Kde "
"opgespoor 'n skakel van reeks van skakel wat resultate in 'n oneindige lus - "
"i.e. die lêer was (miskien in 'n omslagtige weg) gekoppel na self."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:796
msgid "Could Not Create Network Connection"
msgstr "Kon Nie Skep Netwerk Verbinding"

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:797
msgid "Could Not Create Socket"
msgstr "Kon Nie Skep Soket"

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:798
msgid ""
"This is a fairly technical error in which a required device for network "
"communications (a socket) could not be created."
msgstr ""
"Hierdie is 'n redelike tegniese fout in wat 'n benodig toestel vir netwerk "
"kommunikasie ('n soket) kon nie wees geskep."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:800 kio/kio/global.cpp:913 kio/kio/global.cpp:924
#: kio/kio/global.cpp:933
msgid ""
"The network connection may be incorrectly configured, or the network "
"interface may not be enabled."
msgstr ""
"Die netwerk verbinding dalk mag wees verkeerdelik gekonfigureer, of Die "
"netwerk koppelvlak dalk mag nie wees geaktiveer."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:806
msgid "Connection to Server Refused"
msgstr "Verbinding na Bediener Geweier"

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:807
msgid ""
"The server <strong>%1</strong> refused to allow this computer to make a "
"connection."
msgstr ""
"Die bediener <strong>%1</strong>"
" geweier na toelaat hierdie rekenaar na maak 'n verbinding."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:809
msgid ""
"The server, while currently connected to the Internet, may not be configured "
"to allow requests."
msgstr ""
"Die bediener, terwyl huidiglik verbind na Die Internet, dalk mag nie wees "
"gekonfigureer na toelaat versoeke."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:811
msgid ""
"The server, while currently connected to the Internet, may not be running "
"the requested service (%1)."
msgstr ""
"Die bediener, terwyl huidiglik verbind na Die Internet, dalk mag nie wees "
"wat loop Die versoekte diens (%1)."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:813
msgid ""
"A network firewall (a device which restricts Internet requests), either "
"protecting your network or the network of the server, may have intervened, "
"preventing this request."
msgstr ""
"'n netwerk vuurmuur ('n toestel wat beperk Internet versoeke), òf "
"beskerming jou netwerk van die netwerk van die bediener, dalk mag het "
"tussenbyde getree, voorkoming hierdie versoek."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:820
msgid "Connection to Server Closed Unexpectedly"
msgstr "Verbinding na Bediener Gesluit Onverwags"

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:821
msgid ""
"Although a connection was established to <strong>%1</strong>"
", the connection was closed at an unexpected point in the communication."
msgstr ""
"Alhoewel 'n verbinding was vasgestel na <strong>%1</strong>, die verbinding "
"was gesluit na 'n onverwagte punt in die kommunikasie."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:824
msgid ""
"A protocol error may have occurred, causing the server to close the "
"connection as a response to the error."
msgstr ""
"'n protokol fout dalk mag het voorgekom, veroorsaak dat die bediener na maak "
"toe die verbinding as 'n antwoord na die fout."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:830
#, fuzzy
msgid "URL Resource Invalid"
msgstr "Url Hulpbron Ongeldige."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:831
msgid "Protocol %1 is not a Filter Protocol"
msgstr "Protokol %1 is nie 'n Filter Protokol"

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:832
msgid ""
"The <strong>U</strong>niform <strong>R</strong>esource "
"<strong>L</strong>ocator (URL) that you entered did not refer to a valid "
"mechanism of accessing the specific resource, <strong>%1%2</strong>."
msgstr ""

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:837
msgid ""
"KDE is able to communicate through a protocol within a protocol. This "
"request specified a protocol be used as such, however this protocol is not "
"capable of such an action. This is a rare event, and is likely to indicate a "
"programming error."
msgstr ""
"Kde is in staat na kommunikeer deur 'n protokol binne in 'n protokol. "
"Hierdie versoek gespesifiseer 'n protokol wees gebruik word as soos, egter "
"Hierdie protokol is nie moontlikhede van soos 'n aksie. Hierdie is 'n "
"ongewone gebeurtenis, en is waarskynlik na aandui 'n programmering fout."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:845
msgid "Unable to Initialize Input/Output Device"
msgstr "Nie moontlik na Inisialiseer Invoer/Uitset Toestel"

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:846
msgid "Could Not Mount Device"
msgstr "Kon Nie Mount Toestel"

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:847
msgid ""
"The requested device could not be initialized (\"mounted\"). The reported "
"error was: <strong>%1</strong>"
msgstr ""
"Die versoekte toestel kon nie wees geinitialiseer word (\"gekoppelde\"). Die "
"raporteer fout was: <strong>%1</strong>"

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:850
msgid ""
"The device may not be ready, for example there may be no media in a "
"removable media device (i.e. no CD-ROM in a CD drive), or in the case of a "
"peripheral/portable device, the device may not be correctly connected."
msgstr ""
"Die toestel dalk mag nie wees gereed, vir voorbeeld daar dalk mag wees nee "
"media in 'n verwyderbare media toestel (i.e. nee Cd-ROM in 'n Cd dryf), van "
"in Die kas van 'n aanhangsels/draagbaar toestel, Die toestel dalk mag nie "
"wees korrek verbind."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:854
msgid ""
"You may not have permissions to initialize (\"mount\") the device. On UNIX "
"systems, often system administrator privileges are required to initialize a "
"device."
msgstr ""
"Jy dalk mag nie het regte na inisialiseer (\"mount\") die toestel. Op Unix "
"sisteme, gereeld stelsel administrateur voorregte word benodig na "
"inisialiseer 'n toestel."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:858
msgid ""
"Check that the device is ready; removable drives must contain media, and "
"portable devices must be connected and powered on.; and try again."
msgstr ""
"Bevestig wat die toestel is gereed; verwyderbare aandrywers] moet bevat "
"media, en draagbaar toestelle moet wees verbind en geskakel op.; en probeer "
"weer."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:864
msgid "Unable to Uninitialize Input/Output Device"
msgstr "Nie moontlik na Deïnitialiseer Invoer/Uitset Toestel"

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:865
msgid "Could Not Unmount Device"
msgstr "Kon Nie Ontkoppel Toestel"

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:866
msgid ""
"The requested device could not be uninitialized (\"unmounted\"). The "
"reported error was: <strong>%1</strong>"
msgstr ""
"Die versoekte toestel kon nie wees degeïnitialiseer (\"ontkoppel\"). Die "
"raporteer fout was: <strong>%1</strong>"

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:869
msgid ""
"The device may be busy, that is, still in use by another application or "
"user. Even such things as having an open browser window on a location on "
"this device may cause the device to remain in use."
msgstr ""
"Die toestel dalk mag wees besig, wat is, nogsteeds in gebruik deur nog 'n "
"aansoek of gebruiker. Al soos dinge as moet 'n open blaaier venster op 'n "
"ligging op hierdie toestel dalk mag veroorsaak Die toestel na bly in gebruik."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:873
msgid ""
"You may not have permissions to uninitialize (\"unmount\") the device. On "
"UNIX systems, system administrator privileges are often required to "
"uninitialize a device."
msgstr ""
"Jy dalk mag nie het regte na deïnitialiseer (\"ontkoppel\") die toestel. Op "
"Unix sisteme, stelsel administrateur voorregte word gereeld benodig na "
"deïnitialiseer 'n toestel."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:877
msgid "Check that no applications are accessing the device, and try again."
msgstr ""
"Bevestig wat nee programme word toegang te kry tot die toestel, en probeer "
"weer."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:882
msgid "Cannot Read From Resource"
msgstr "Kan nie Lees Van Hulpbron"

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:883
msgid ""
"This means that although the resource, <strong>%1</strong>, was able to be "
"opened, an error occurred while reading the contents of the resource."
msgstr ""
"Hierdie beteken wat alhoewel die hulpbron, <strong>%1</strong>"
", was in staat na wees geöpende, 'n fout voorgekom terwyl lees die inhoud "
"van die hulpbron."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:886
msgid "You may not have permissions to read from the resource."
msgstr "Jy dalk mag nie het regte na lees van die hulpbron."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:895
msgid "Cannot Write to Resource"
msgstr "Kan nie Skryf na Hulpbron"

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:896
msgid ""
"This means that although the resource, <strong>%1</strong>, was able to be "
"opened, an error occurred while writing to the resource."
msgstr ""
"Hierdie beteken wat alhoewel die hulpbron, <strong>%1</strong>"
", was in staat na wees geöpende, 'n fout voorgekom terwyl om te skryf na "
"die hulpbron."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:899
msgid "You may not have permissions to write to the resource."
msgstr "Jy dalk mag nie het regte na skryf na die hulpbron."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:908 kio/kio/global.cpp:919
msgid "Could Not Listen for Network Connections"
msgstr "Kon Nie Luister vir Netwerk Koppelinge"

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:909
msgid "Could Not Bind"
msgstr "Kon Nie Bind"

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:910 kio/kio/global.cpp:921
msgid ""
"This is a fairly technical error in which a required device for network "
"communications (a socket) could not be established to listen for incoming "
"network connections."
msgstr ""
"Hierdie is 'n redelike tegniese fout in wat 'n benodig toestel vir netwerk "
"kommunikasie ('n soket) kon nie wees vasgestel na luister vir inkomende "
"netwerk koppelinge."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:920
msgid "Could Not Listen"
msgstr "Kon Nie Luister"

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:930
msgid "Could Not Accept Network Connection"
msgstr "Kon Nie Aanvaar Netwerk Verbinding"

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:931
msgid ""
"This is a fairly technical error in which an error occurred while attempting "
"to accept an incoming network connection."
msgstr ""
"Hierdie is 'n redelike tegniese fout in wat 'n fout voorgekom terwyl probeer "
"na aanvaar 'n inkomende netwerk verbinding."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:935
msgid "You may not have permissions to accept the connection."
msgstr "Jy dalk mag nie het regte na aanvaar die verbinding."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:940
#, c-format
msgid "Could Not Login: %1"
msgstr "Kon Nie Aanteken: %1"

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:941
msgid "An attempt to login to perform the requested operation was unsuccessful."
msgstr "'n poog na aanteken na aan te bring die versoekte operasie was onsuksesvol."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:952
msgid "Could Not Determine Resource Status"
msgstr "Kon Nie Bepaal Hulpbron Status"

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:953
msgid "Could Not Stat Resource"
msgstr "Kon Nie Statistiek Hulpbron"

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:954
msgid ""
"An attempt to determine information about the status of the resource "
"<strong>%1</strong>, such as the resource name, type, size, etc., was "
"unsuccessful."
msgstr ""
"'n poog na bepaal informasie aangaande die status van die hulpbron "
"<strong>%1</strong>, soos as die hulpbron naam, tipe, grootte, etc., was "
"onsuksesvol."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:957
msgid "The specified resource may not have existed or may not be accessible."
msgstr ""
"Die gespesifiseer hulpbron dalk mag nie het bestaan of dalk mag nie wees "
"toeganklik."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:965
msgid "Could Not Cancel Listing"
msgstr "Kon Nie Kanseleer Luister na"

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:966
msgid "FIXME: Document this"
msgstr "Maakreg: Dokument hierdie"

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:970
msgid "Could Not Create Directory"
msgstr "Kon Nie Skep Gids"

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:971
msgid "An attempt to create the requested directory failed."
msgstr "'n poog na skep die versoekte gids gevaal."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:972
msgid "The location where the directory was to be created may not exist."
msgstr "Die ligging waar Die gids was na wees geskep dalk mag nie bestaan."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:979
msgid "Could Not Remove Directory"
msgstr "Kon Nie Verwyder Gids"

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:980
msgid "An attempt to remove the specified directory, <strong>%1</strong>, failed."
msgstr "'n poog na verwyder die gespesifiseer gids, <strong>%1</strong>, gevaal."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:982
msgid "The specified directory may not exist."
msgstr "Die gespesifiseer gids dalk mag nie bestaan."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:983
msgid "The specified directory may not be empty."
msgstr "Die gespesifiseer gids dalk mag nie wees leeg."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:986
msgid "Ensure that the directory exists and is empty, and try again."
msgstr "Maak seker wat die gids bestaan en is leeg, en probeer weer."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:991
msgid "Could Not Resume File Transfer"
msgstr "Kon Nie Voortgaan Lêer Oordra"

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:992
msgid ""
"The specified request asked that the transfer of file <strong>%1</strong>"
" be resumed at a certain point of the transfer. This was not possible."
msgstr ""
"Die gespesifiseer versoek gevra wat Die oordra van lêer <strong>%1</strong>"
" wees hervat na 'n sekere punt van Die oordra. Hierdie was nie moontlik."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:995
msgid "The protocol, or the server, may not support file resuming."
msgstr "Die protokol, of Die bediener, dalk mag nie ondersteun lêer hervatting."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:997
msgid "Retry the request without attempting to resume transfer."
msgstr "Herprobeer die versoek sonder om te probeer na voortgaan oordra."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:1002
msgid "Could Not Rename Resource"
msgstr "Kon Nie Herbenaam Hulpbron"

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:1003
msgid "An attempt to rename the specified resource <strong>%1</strong> failed."
msgstr "'n poog na herbenaam die gespesifiseer hulpbron <strong>%1</strong> gevaal."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:1011
msgid "Could Not Alter Permissions of Resource"
msgstr "Kon Nie Verander Regte van Hulpbron"

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:1012
msgid ""
"An attempt to alter the permissions on the specified resource "
"<strong>%1</strong> failed."
msgstr ""
"'n poog na verander die regte op die gespesifiseer hulpbron "
"<strong>%1</strong> gevaal."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:1019
msgid "Could Not Delete Resource"
msgstr "Kon Nie Uitvee Hulpbron"

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:1020
msgid "An attempt to delete the specified resource <strong>%1</strong> failed."
msgstr "'n poog na uitvee die gespesifiseer hulpbron <strong>%1</strong> gevaal."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:1027
msgid "Unexpected Program Termination"
msgstr "Onverwagte Program Beëindiging"

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:1028
msgid ""
"The program on your computer which provides access to the "
"<strong>%1</strong> protocol has unexpectedly terminated."
msgstr ""
"Die program op jou rekenaar wat verskaf toegang verkry na Die "
"<strong>%1</strong> protokol het onverwags beëindig."

#: kab/addressbook.cc:420 kab/addressbook.cc:1068 kio/kio/global.cpp:1036
msgid "Out of Memory"
msgstr "Uit van Geheue"

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:1037
msgid ""
"The program on your computer which provides access to the "
"<strong>%1</strong> protocol could not obtain the memory required to "
"continue."
msgstr ""
"Die program op jou rekenaar wat verskaf toegang verkry na Die "
"<strong>%1</strong> protokol kon nie verkry Die geheue benodig na gaan voort."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:1045
msgid "Unknown Proxy Host"
msgstr "Onbekende Volmag Bediener"

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:1046
msgid ""
"While retrieving information about the specified proxy host, "
"<strong>%1</strong>, an Unknown Host error was encountered. An unknown host "
"error indicates that the requested name could not be located on the Internet."
msgstr ""
"Terwyl onttrek informasie aangaande die gespesifiseer volmag bediener, "
"<strong>%1</strong>"
", 'n Onbekende bediener fout was raakgeloop. 'n Onbekende bediener fout dui "
"aan wat die versoekte naam kon nie wees geleë op die Internet."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:1050
msgid ""
"There may have been a problem with your network configuration, specifically "
"your proxy's hostname. If you have been accessing the Internet with no "
"problems recently, this is unlikely."
msgstr ""

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:1054
msgid "Double-check your proxy settings and try again."
msgstr "Double-check jou volmag instellings en probeer weer."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:1059
msgid "Authentication Failed: Method %1 Not Supported"
msgstr "Geldigheidsverklaring Gevaal: Metode %1 Nie Ondersteunde"

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:1061
#, c-format
msgid ""
"Although you may have supplied the correct authentication details, the "
"authentication failed because the method that the server is using is not "
"supported by the KDE program implementing the protocol %1."
msgstr ""
"Alhoewel jy dalk mag het verskaf die korrek geldigheidsverklaring details, "
"die geldigheidsverklaring gevaal omdat die metode wat die bediener is te "
"gebruik is nie ondersteunde deur die Kde program implementering die protokol "
"%1."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:1065
msgid ""
"Please file a bug at <a "
"href=\"http://bugs.kde.org/\">http://bugs.kde.org/</a> to inform the KDE "
"team of the unsupported authentication method."
msgstr ""

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:1071
msgid "Request Aborted"
msgstr "Versoek Gekanselleer"

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:1078
msgid "Internal Error in Server"
msgstr "Intern Fout in Bediener"

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:1079
msgid ""
"The program on the server which provides access to the <strong>%1</strong> "
"protocol has reported an internal error: %0."
msgstr ""
"Die program op Die bediener wat verskaf toegang verkry na Die "
"<strong>%1</strong> protokol het raporteer 'n intern fout: %0."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:1082
msgid ""
"This is most likely to be caused by a bug in the server program. Please "
"consider submitting a full bug report as detailed below."
msgstr ""
"Hierdie is mees waarskynlik na wees veroorsaak deur 'n fout in die bediener "
"program. Asseblief beskou instuur 'n volgrote fout raporteer as "
"gedetaileerde onder."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:1085
msgid "Contact the administrator of the server to advise them of the problem."
msgstr ""
"Kontak die administrateur van die bediener na stel voor hulle van die "
"probleem."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:1087
msgid ""
"If you know who the authors of the server software are, submit the bug "
"report directly to them."
msgstr ""
"As jy ken wie die outeure van die bediener sagteware word, stuur in die fout "
"raporteer direk na hulle."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:1092
msgid "Timeout Error"
msgstr "Tydverstreke Fout"

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:1093
msgid ""
"Although contact was made with the server, a response was not received "
"within the amount of time allocated for the request as "
"follows:"
"<ul>"
"<li>Timeout for establishing a connection: %1 seconds</li>"
"<li>Timeout for receiving a response: %2 seconds</li>"
"<li>Timeout for accessing proxy servers: %3 seconds</li></ul>Please note "
"that you can alter these timeout settings in the KDE Control Center, by "
"selecting Network -> Preferences."
msgstr ""
"Alhoewel kontak was gemaak met die bediener, 'n antwoord was nie ontvang "
"binne in die hoeveelheid van tyd geallokeer vir die versoek as "
"volg:"
"<ul>"
"<li>Tydverstreke vir opstel 'n verbinding: %1 sekondes</li>"
"<li>Tydverstreke vir ontvang 'n antwoord: %2 sekondes</li>"
"<li>Tydverstreke vir toegang te kry tot volmag bedieners: %3 "
"sekondes</li></ul>Asseblief nota wat jy kan verander hierdie Tydverstreke "
"instellings in die Kde Kontrole Sentrum, deur deur te kies Netwerk -> "
"Voorkeure."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:1104
msgid "The server was too busy responding to other requests to respond."
msgstr "Die bediener was te besig reageer na ander versoeke na antwoord."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:1110
msgid "Unknown Error"
msgstr "Onbekende Fout"

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:1111
msgid ""
"The program on your computer which provides access to the "
"<strong>%1</strong> protocol has reported an unknown error: %2."
msgstr ""
"Die program op jou rekenaar wat verskaf toegang verkry na Die "
"<strong>%1</strong> protokol het raporteer 'n onbekende fout: %2."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:1119
msgid "Unknown Interruption"
msgstr "Onbekende Onderbreking"

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:1120
msgid ""
"The program on your computer which provides access to the "
"<strong>%1</strong> protocol has reported an interruption of an unknown "
"type: %2."
msgstr ""
"Die program op jou rekenaar wat verskaf toegang verkry na Die "
"<strong>%1</strong> protokol het raporteer 'n onderbreking van 'n onbekende "
"tipe: %2."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:1128
msgid "Could Not Delete Original File"
msgstr "Kon Nie Uitvee Oorspronklike Lêer"

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:1129
msgid ""
"The requested operation required the deleting of the original file, most "
"likely at the end of a file move operation. The original file "
"<strong>%1</strong> could not be deleted."
msgstr ""
"Die versoekte operasie benodig Die uitveeïng van Die oorspronklike lêer, "
"mees waarskynlik na Die einde van 'n lêer beweeg operasie. Die "
"oorspronklike lêer <strong>%1</strong> kon nie wees uitgevee."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:1138
msgid "Could Not Delete Temporary File"
msgstr "Kon Nie Uitvee Tydelike Lêer"

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:1139
msgid ""
"The requested operation required the creation of a temporary file in which "
"to save the new file while being downloaded. This temporary file "
"<strong>%1</strong> could not be deleted."
msgstr ""
"Die versoekte operasie benodig Die skep van 'n tydelike lêer in wat na "
"stoor Die nuwe lêer terwyl te wees afgelaai. Hierdie tydelike lêer "
"<strong>%1</strong> kon nie wees uitgevee."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:1148
msgid "Could Not Rename Original File"
msgstr "Kon Nie Herbenaam Oorspronklike Lêer"

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:1149
msgid ""
"The requested operation required the renaming of the original file "
"<strong>%1</strong>, however it could not be renamed."
msgstr ""
"Die versoekte operasie benodig Die herbenaming van Die oorspronklike lêer "
"<strong>%1</strong>, egter dit kon nie wees herbenaam."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:1157
msgid "Could Not Rename Temporary File"
msgstr "Kon Nie Herbenaam Tydelike Lêer"

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:1158
msgid ""
"The requested operation required the creation of a temporary file "
"<strong>%1</strong>, however it could not be created."
msgstr ""
"Die versoekte operasie benodig Die skep van 'n tydelike lêer "
"<strong>%1</strong>, egter dit kon nie wees geskep."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:1166
msgid "Could Not Create Link"
msgstr "Kon Nie Skep Skakel"

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:1167
msgid "Could Not Create Symbolic Link"
msgstr "Kon Nie Skep Simboliese Skakel"

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:1168
